### Phase 8 — Interview demo (Gateway :8080)

# 1) Public catalog
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/hotels

# 2) Login (seeded customer)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@stayfinder.local",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

# 3) My bookings without token — 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/my

# 4) Create PENDING booking (paste accessToken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "checkIn": "2026-10-10",
  "checkOut": "2026-10-12"
}

# 5) Food against PENDING — 400 (needs CONFIRMED)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/food/orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": 1,
  "bookingId": 1,
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 1 }]
}

# 6) Confirm — 200, then Notification log + Kafka
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

# 7) Food against CONFIRMED — 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/food/orders
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": 1,
  "bookingId": 1,
  "roomNumber": "101",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": 1, "quantity": 1 }]
}

# 8) Overlap — 409 (same room/dates)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "checkIn": "2026-10-10",
  "checkOut": "2026-10-12"
}

# 9) Customer creating a hotel — 403
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/hotels
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Should Fail",
  "city": "Hyderabad"
}

# 10) Circuit demo: stop booking-service, repeat food POST, then:
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/circuitbreakers
